# Real recurring problem in this project's history: the ios/ folder
# was repeatedly broken by Windows-style line endings/paths creeping
# into files that macOS/Xcode Cloud need in Unix form to execute or
# resolve correctly (shell scripts, Swift package manifests). This
# guarantees the files that actually matter for that always keep
# Unix line endings, regardless of core.autocrlf or any other local
# Git setting on whichever machine (Windows or Mac) commits them.
*.sh text eol=lf
ios/App/ci_scripts/* text eol=lf
Package.swift text eol=lf
